---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
const title = "French Riviera Tips | About Max & Our Mission | Côte d'Azur";
const jsonld = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'AboutPage',
  name: 'About French Riviera Tips',
};
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description="Who's behind French Riviera Tips — Max, a local writing honest, first-hand guides to the Côte d'Azur." jsonld={jsonld}>
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:40px;max-width:760px">
    <nav style="font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);display:flex;gap:8px"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></nav>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div style="width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--deep);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque';font-weight:800;font-size:30px;flex-shrink:0">M</div>
      <div>
        <h1 style="font-weight:800;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-0.03em">Hi, I'm Max</h1>
        <p style="color:var(--soft);font-size:16px;margin-top:4px">I write these guides from the Côte d'Azur.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:28px">
      <p>French Riviera Tips started as a simple idea: share the coast the way a local actually experiences it — not the glossy, over-priced version, but the real Riviera of morning markets, hidden coves, quiet villages and the trains that connect them all.</p>
      <p>I write every guide from first-hand experience. I visit the hotels I recommend, walk the beaches, ride the buses and trains, and only publish what I'd tell a friend. <strong>I never accept payment for reviews</strong>, and I'll always tell you when a link is an affiliate one.</p>
      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
      <p>Practical, up-to-date guides across seven themes — destinations, hotels, activities, events, hidden gems and tips — covering Nice, Cannes, Monaco, Antibes and the villages in between. Everything is written for English-speaking travellers planning a trip to the coast.</p>
      <h2>How we keep the lights on</h2>
      <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links (hotels via Stay22 and Booking/Expedia, flights and transfers via Travelpayouts and partners). If you book through them, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you — it's what keeps these guides free and independent. Read the full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
      <h2 id="contact">Get in touch</h2>
      <p>Spotted something out of date, or want a recommendation for your trip? Email <a href="mailto:hello@frenchrivieratips.com">hello@frenchrivieratips.com</a> — I read every message.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Newsletter />
</BaseLayout>
